  "note": "In the Grade 4-7 blocks the second printed column is headed 'Team' and holds a team colour (White/Blue/Red), not a job title; it is recorded in role_raw exactly as printed, and grade_or_dept says which grade block it belongs to. Line 18: 'Emily Clarke' is printed in the role column of the line that also carries the 'Learning Ctr./SPED' heading, so which section she belongs to cannot be told from the page; her grade_or_dept is left empty rather than guessed. Line 22: the role 'Gr. 6 Teacher' is printed at an offset belonging to the third column, but the col.1 name/role sequence runs Gr. 4, Gr. 5, [22], Gr. 7, so it is paired with Linda Papadopoulos. Line 22 also carries a Grade 6 team value 'Red' with no name beside it; it is recorded as an entry with an empty name."
